# 🚀 Automated Deployment of Dockerized Portfolio Website on AWS EC2 using GitHub Actions

## 📖 Project Overview

This project demonstrates an end-to-end CI/CD pipeline for deploying a Dockerized Portfolio Website on an AWS EC2 instance using GitHub Actions. The deployment process is fully automated—every push to the `main` branch triggers GitHub Actions to build a Docker image, push it to Docker Hub, connect securely to the EC2 instance using SSH, pull the latest image, and deploy the updated application behind an Nginx Reverse Proxy.

