## ⚙️ CI/CD Workflow

```
Developer
     │
     ▼
Push Code to GitHub
     │
     ▼
GitHub Actions
     │
     ├── Checkout Source Code
     ├── Build Docker Image
     ├── Push Image to Docker Hub
     └── SSH into AWS EC2
              │
              ▼
      Pull Latest Docker Image
              │
              ▼
      Stop Old Container
              │
              ▼
      Start New Container
              │
              ▼
      Nginx Reverse Proxy
              │
              ▼
      Live Portfolio Website
```

