## 🐳 Docker Commands Used

### Build Docker Image

```bash
docker build -t portfolio-website .
```

### Run Docker Container

```bash
docker run -d -p 8080:80 portfolio-website
```

### List Running Containers

```bash
docker ps
```

### Stop Container

```bash
docker stop app
```

### Remove Container

```bash
docker rm app
```

