## ☁️ Deployment Process

1. Developed a responsive portfolio website.
2. Created a Dockerfile for containerization.
3. Built and tested the Docker image locally.
4. Pushed the Docker image to Docker Hub.
5. Launched an AWS EC2 Ubuntu instance.
6. Installed Docker and Nginx on the EC2 instance.
7. Configured Nginx as a reverse proxy.
8. Generated SSH keys for secure authentication.
9. Configured GitHub Secrets.
10. Created a GitHub Actions workflow.
11. Enabled automatic deployment after every push to the `main` branch.

